edn-24-  {:doc \"Compile the Node yin.repl (shadow-cljs build :yin-repl) to target/yin-repl.js\"\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/bb.edn-25-   ;; The Node lanes (test:cljs and its variants) depend on this task, so the"}]}],"meta":{"source":"tool","messageId":"78d8241a-f5c4-46eb-95f3-5a6b1275ebb6"}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"bb.edn: Only the addition of the build:jolt-native task (lines 18–21). Good.\n\nNext, check the key logs: final-probe.log (number of PASSes — the brief says 6, the report says 7/7), r1-neg-sha.log (reason for exit code 1), r2-gen-verify.log (digest match), and possibly the tail of r3-build.log. Let's read final-probe.log, r1-neg-sha.log, and r2-gen-verify.log.\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_c325cfb5418b41e2a77bf44c","name":"read_file","input":{"paths":["/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/build/j0c/logs/final-probe.log","/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/build/j0c/logs/r1-neg-sha.log","/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/build/j0c/logs/r2-gen-verify.log"]}}],"meta":{"source":"model","createdAt":1792460128542,"messageId":"60c64d29-0ee3-40a9-a437-e0ffb4b6c1c6"}},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_c325cfb5418b41e2a77bf44c","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read 3/3 files\n--- File Contents ---\n\n// File: .claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/build/j0c/logs/final-probe.log (log)\nlibrary /Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/build/native/darwin-arm64/jolt-parser/lib/libjolt_parser.dylib\nPASS layout version entry answers 1 1\nRECORD parse \"1 + 2\\n\": {:status 0, :buffer-bytes 3196, :ms 3.593}\nRECORD first 32 buffer bytes: [74 80 84 49 1 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 119 0 0 0 12 0 0 0 115 105 110 103 108 101 95 105 110 112 117 116]\nfile_input\n  stmt\n    simple_stmts\n      simple_stmt\n        expr_stmt\n          testlist_star_expr\n            test\n              or_test\n                and_test\