:355`, V)                   | may format differently; the text is display only, never  |\n413: |                                                     |                                        | persisted or hashed. Allowlisted in list 1 (§8). No      |\n414: |                                                     |                                        | slice.                                                   |\n415: +-----------------------------------------------------+----------------------------------------+----------------------------------------------------------+\n416: \n417: ### 3.2 Resolved effect calls, corrected (V)\n418: \n419: `random-uuid`: **27 lines in `src/cljc`, 26 in the adopted closure**; the\n420: 27th is `dao/postgraphics/terminal.cljc:14`, out of scope (OQ1). The 26:\n421: `dao/stream/ringbuffer.cljc:27,185`; `memory_log.cljc:73`; `ws.cljc:122`;\n422: `remote.cljc:1249`; `remote_pair.cljc:180`; `remote_route.cljc:173`;\n423: `journal.cljc:296`; `dao/jing/content/step.cljc:132`; `dao/lease.cljc:594`;\n424: `dao/await.cljc:235,240`; `dao/space/store/fs.cljc:137,351`;\n425: `yin/vm/linker.cljc:1685`; `yin/vm/ucf/custody.cljc:46`;\n426: `yin/vm/ucf/holder/driver.cljc:1507`; `yin/vm/ffi/remote_serve.cljc:417,604,606`;\n427: `yin/vm/telemetry.cljc:112`; `yin/repl.cljc:667,668,733,918`;\n428: `yin/repl/dht.cljc:117`. Other sources: `rand` at `rpc.cljc:114-116`,\n429: `rand-int` at `jing/dht.cljc:373`; secure generators at\n430: `space/dht.cljc:142-151` and `sign.cljc:119-123`; `gensym` at three sites;\n431: clocks at `main.cljc:1242-1542` (driver) and `driver.clj:169,206` (JVM lane);\n432: ambient at `fs.cljc:92,136,271-273`, `repl.cljc:275-277`, `main.cljc`;\n433: printing at `main.cljc` (19) and `antlr/repl.cljc:71`; timers at\n434: `async.cljc:52-57`, `storage.cljc:224-227`, `main.cljc:1321,1343`. All are\n435: deferred-scope entries (§9) except the clocks and printing in `main.cljc`\n436: (driver). None is in an H0-H4 file.\n437: \n438: ### 3.3 Exe